    "You will stop receiving approval requests on this phone until you pair again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解除后，在重新配对之前，此手机将不再收到审批请求。"
